ion","loc":"p.3, §2.1"},{"id":"E07","cond":"D04","quote":"The training target of the denoising network is to minimize the Mean Squared Error (MSE) between the predicted velocity and the true velocity","loc":"p.3, §2.1"},{"id":"E08","cond":"D15","quote":"The training target of the denoising network is to minimize the Mean Squared Error (MSE) between the predicted velocity and the true velocity","loc":"p.3, §2.1"},{"id":"E09","cond":"D07.rule","quote":"During the inference phase, the model starts from pure noise and iteratively updates the latent vector in descending order of time steps to ultimately generate text","loc":"p.4, §2.1"},{"id":"E10","cond":"S08","quote":"Language encoder: Pre-trained BART model, fine-tuned on the QQP dataset to output bias-aware text features","loc":"p.7, §3.2.1"},{"id":"E11","cond":"S10.steps","quote":"For evaluation, the number of time steps T is set to 250, and the length and hidden dimension of the latent representation are set to L = 32 and D = 64, respectively","loc":"p.7, §3.2.2"},{"id":"E12","cond":"S10.gen_length","quote":"For evaluation, the number of time steps T is set to 250, and the length and hidden dimension of the latent representation are set to L = 32 and D = 64, respectively","loc":"p.7, §3.2.2"},{"id":"E13","cond":"S13","quote":"Introducing a multi-dimensional bias diagnosis framework: Integrating evaluation metrics from classification tasks (BBQ), including quantitative indicators such as accuracy in ambiguous/disambiguated","loc":"p.2, §1"},{"id":"E14","cond":"CL1","quote":"it introduces a decoupled cross-attention mechanism and adds an adapter module to the Transformer-Encoder, optimizing only < 5% of adapter parameters","loc":"p.1, abstract"},{"id":"E15","cond":"CL2","quote":"it outperforms baselines like Qwen3 and Language Diffusion for Language Generation (LD4LG), achieving a top accuracy of 73.7% and a maximum accuracy difference of 9.6% in non-ambiguous contexts","loc":"p.1, abstract"},{"id":"E16","cond":"CL2","quote":"the ΔAcc reaches 9.6 for the \"Religion\" category and 7.3 for the \"Nationality\" category","loc":"p.11, §3.5.1"},{"id":"E17","cond":"CL3","quote":"achieving a speedup of approximately 3 times compared to full-parameter fine-tuning","loc":"p.2, §1"},{"id":"E18","cond":"H01","quote":"it outperforms baselines like Qwen3 and Language Diffusion for Language Generation (LD4LG), achieving a top accuracy of 73.7% and a maximum accuracy difference of 9.6% in non-ambiguous contexts","loc":"p.1, abstract"},{"id":"E19","cond":"H02","quote":"it outperforms baselines like Qwen3 and Language Diffusion for Language Generation (LD4LG), achieving a top accuracy of 73.7% and a maximum accuracy difference of 9.6% in non-ambiguous contexts","loc":"p.1, abstract"},{"id":"E20","cond":"CT4","quote":"it outperforms baselines like Qwen3 and Language Diffusion for Language Generation (LD4LG), achieving a top accuracy of 73.7% and a maximum accuracy difference of 9.6% in non-ambiguous contexts","loc":"p.1, abstract"},{"id":"E21","cond":"CT6","quote":"it outperforms baselines like Qwen3 and Language Diffusion for Language Generation (LD4LG), achieving a top accuracy of 73.7% and a maximum accuracy difference of 9.6% in non-ambiguous contexts","loc":"p.1, abstract"},{"id":"E22","cond":"I1","quote":"Qwen3-0.6B-Instruct: An autoregressive large language model developed by Alibaba Cloud, fine-tuned on instruction data with a parameter scale of 0.6B","loc":"p.8, §3.3"},{"id":"E23","cond":"I2","quote":"A text diffusion model adopting the same LDM framework as Debias-Adapter but without a dedicated debiasing module, serving as a same-framework baseline","loc":"p.8, §3.3"},{"id":"E24","cond":"F2","quote":"To dynamically balance fairness and generation quality during inference, a classifier-free guidance mechanism is introduced, enabling flexible regulation by adjusting the weight","loc":"p.6, §2.3.3"},{"id":"E25","cond":"QA3d","quote":"All experiments are conducted on a server equipped with